{"number":75,"nameArabic":"القيامة","nameTransliterated":"Al-Qiyamah","nameTranslated":"The Resurrection","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":40,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"75:1","textAr":"لَآ أُقۡسِمُ بِيَوۡمِ ٱلۡقِيَٰمَةِ","transliteration":"La oqsimu biyawmi alqiyamati","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"I swear by the Day of Resurrection"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"نہیں، میں قسم کھاتا ہوں قیامت کے دن کی"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"75:2","textAr":"وَلَآ أُقۡسِمُ بِٱلنَّفۡسِ ٱللَّوَّامَةِ","transliteration":"Wala oqsimu bialnnafsi allawwamati","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And I swear by the reproaching soul [to the certainty of resurrection]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور نہیں، میں قسم کھاتا ہوں ملامت کرنے والے نفس کی"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"75:3","textAr":"أَيَحۡسَبُ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ أَلَّن نَّجۡمَعَ عِظَامَهُۥ","transliteration":"Ayahsabu alinsanu allan najmaAAa AAithamahu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Does man think that We will not assemble his bones"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کیا انسان یہ سمجھ رہا ہے کہ ہم اُس کی ہڈیوں کو جمع نہ کر سکیں گے؟"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"75:4","textAr":"بَلَىٰ قَٰدِرِينَ عَلَىٰٓ أَن نُّسَوِّيَ بَنَانَهُۥ","transliteration":"Bala qadireena AAala an nusawwiya bananahu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Yes. [We are] Able [even] to proportion his fingertips"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہم تو اس کی انگلیوں کی پور پور تک ٹھیک بنا دینے پر قادر ہیں"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"75:5","textAr":"بَلۡ يُرِيدُ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ لِيَفۡجُرَ أَمَامَهُۥ","transliteration":"Bal yureedu alinsanu liyafjura amamahu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"But man desires to continue in sin"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"مگر انسان چاہتا یہ ہے کہ آگے بھی بد اعمالیاں کرتا رہے"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"75:6","textAr":"يَسۡـَٔلُ أَيَّانَ يَوۡمُ ٱلۡقِيَٰمَةِ","transliteration":"Yasalu ayyana yawmu alqiyamati","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"He asks, \"When is the Day of Resurrection"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پوچھتا ہے \"آخر کب آنا ہے وہ قیامت کا دن؟"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"75:7","textAr":"فَإِذَا بَرِقَ ٱلۡبَصَرُ","transliteration":"Faitha bariqa albasaru","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So when vision is dazzled"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر جب دیدے پتھرا جائیں گے"}]},{"ayah":8,"verseKey":"75:8","textAr":"وَخَسَفَ ٱلۡقَمَرُ","transliteration":"Wakhasafa alqamaru","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And the moon darkens"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور چاند بے نور ہو جائیگا"}]},{"ayah":9,"verseKey":"75:9","textAr":"وَجُمِعَ ٱلشَّمۡسُ وَٱلۡقَمَرُ","transliteration":"WajumiAAa alshshamsu waalqamaru","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And the sun and the moon are joined"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور چاند سورج ملا کر ایک کر دیے جائیں گے"}]},{"ayah":10,"verseKey":"75:10","textAr":"يَقُولُ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ يَوۡمَئِذٍ أَيۡنَ ٱلۡمَفَرُّ","transliteration":"Yaqoolu alinsanu yawmaithin ayna almafarru","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Man will say on that Day, \"Where is the [place of] escape"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس وقت یہی انسان کہے گا \"کہاں بھاگ کر جاؤں؟"}]},{"ayah":11,"verseKey":"75:11","textAr":"كَلَّا لَا وَزَرَ","transliteration":"Kalla la wazara","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"No! There is no refuge"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہرگز نہیں، وہاں کوئی جائے پناہ نہ ہوگی"}]},{"ayah":12,"verseKey":"75:12","textAr":"إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ يَوۡمَئِذٍ ٱلۡمُسۡتَقَرُّ","transliteration":"Ila rabbika yawmaithin almustaqarru","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"To your Lord, that Day, is the [place of] permanence"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس روز تیرے رب ہی کے سامنے جا کر ٹھیرنا ہوگا"}]},{"ayah":13,"verseKey":"75:13","textAr":"يُنَبَّؤُاْ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ يَوۡمَئِذِۭ بِمَا قَدَّمَ وَأَخَّرَ","transliteration":"Yunabbao alinsanu yawmaithin bima qaddama waakhkhara","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Man will be informed that Day of what he sent ahead and kept back"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس روز انسان کو اس کا سب اگلا پچھلا کیا کرایا بتا دیا جائے گا"}]},{"ayah":14,"verseKey":"75:14","textAr":"بَلِ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ عَلَىٰ نَفۡسِهِۦ بَصِيرَةٞ","transliteration":"Bali alinsanu AAala nafsihi baseeratun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Rather, man, against himself, will be a witness"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"بلکہ انسان خود ہی اپنے آپ کو خوب جانتا ہے"}]},{"ayah":15,"verseKey":"75:15","textAr":"وَلَوۡ أَلۡقَىٰ مَعَاذِيرَهُۥ","transliteration":"Walaw alqa maAAatheerahu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Even if he presents his excuses"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"چاہے وہ کتنی ہی معذرتیں پیش کرے"}]},{"ayah":16,"verseKey":"75:16","textAr":"لَا تُحَرِّكۡ بِهِۦ لِسَانَكَ لِتَعۡجَلَ بِهِۦٓ","transliteration":"La tuharrik bihi lisanaka litaAAjala bihi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Move not your tongue with it, [O Muhammad], to hasten with recitation of the Qur'an"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اے نبیؐ، اِس وحی کو جلدی جلدی یاد کرنے کے لیے اپنی زبان کو حرکت نہ دو"}]},{"ayah":17,"verseKey":"75:17","textAr":"إِنَّ عَلَيۡنَا جَمۡعَهُۥ وَقُرۡءَانَهُۥ","transliteration":"Inna AAalayna jamAAahu waquranahu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, upon Us is its collection [in your heart] and [to make possible] its recitation"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اِس کو یاد کرا دینا اور پڑھوا دینا ہمارے ذمہ ہے"}]},{"ayah":18,"verseKey":"75:18","textAr":"فَإِذَا قَرَأۡنَٰهُ فَٱتَّبِعۡ قُرۡءَانَهُۥ","transliteration":"Faitha qaranahu faittabiAA quranahu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So when We have recited it [through Gabriel], then follow its recitation"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"لہٰذا جب ہم اِسے پڑھ رہے ہوں اُس وقت تم اِس کی قرات کو غور سے سنتے رہو"}]},{"ayah":19,"verseKey":"75:19","textAr":"ثُمَّ إِنَّ عَلَيۡنَا بَيَانَهُۥ","transliteration":"Thumma inna AAalayna bayanahu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then upon Us is its clarification [to you]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر اس کا مطلب سمجھا دینا بھی ہمارے ذمہ ہے"}]},{"ayah":20,"verseKey":"75:20","textAr":"كَلَّا بَلۡ تُحِبُّونَ ٱلۡعَاجِلَةَ","transliteration":"Kalla bal tuhibboona alAAajilata","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"No! But you love the immediate"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہرگز نہیں، اصل بات یہ ہے کہ تم لوگ جلدی حاصل ہونے والی چیز (یعنی دنیا) سے محبت رکھتے ہو"}]},{"ayah":21,"verseKey":"75:21","textAr":"وَتَذَرُونَ ٱلۡأٓخِرَةَ","transliteration":"Watatharoona alakhirata","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And leave the Hereafter"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور آخرت کو چھوڑ دیتے ہو"}]},{"ayah":22,"verseKey":"75:22","textAr":"وُجُوهٞ يَوۡمَئِذٖ نَّاضِرَةٌ","transliteration":"Wujoohun yawmaithin nadiratun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[Some] faces, that Day, will be radiant"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس روز کچھ چہرے تر و تازہ ہونگے"}]},{"ayah":23,"verseKey":"75:23","textAr":"إِلَىٰ رَبِّهَا نَاظِرَةٞ","transliteration":"Ila rabbiha nathiratun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Looking at their Lord"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اپنے رب کی طرف دیکھ رہے ہونگے"}]},{"ayah":24,"verseKey":"75:24","textAr":"وَوُجُوهٞ يَوۡمَئِذِۭ بَاسِرَةٞ","transliteration":"Wawujoohun yawmaithin basiratun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And [some] faces, that Day, will be contorted"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور کچھ چہرے اداس ہوں گے"}]},{"ayah":25,"verseKey":"75:25","textAr":"تَظُنُّ أَن يُفۡعَلَ بِهَا فَاقِرَةٞ","transliteration":"Tathunnu an yufAAala biha faqiratun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Expecting that there will be done to them [something] backbreaking"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور سمجھ رہے ہوں گے کہ اُن کے ساتھ کمر توڑ برتاؤ ہونے والا ہے"}]},{"ayah":26,"verseKey":"75:26","textAr":"كَلَّآ إِذَا بَلَغَتِ ٱلتَّرَاقِيَ","transliteration":"Kalla itha balaghati alttaraqiya","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"No! When the soul has reached the collar bones"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہرگز نہیں، جب جان حلق تک پہنچ جائے گی"}]},{"ayah":27,"verseKey":"75:27","textAr":"وَقِيلَ مَنۡۜ رَاقٖ","transliteration":"Waqeela man raqin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And it is said, \"Who will cure [him]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور کہا جائے گا کہ ہے کوئی جھاڑ پھونک کرنے والا"}]},{"ayah":28,"verseKey":"75:28","textAr":"وَظَنَّ أَنَّهُ ٱلۡفِرَاقُ","transliteration":"Wathanna annahu alfiraqu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And the dying one is certain that it is the [time of] separation"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور آدمی سمجھ لے گا کہ یہ دنیا سے جدائی کا وقت ہے"}]},{"ayah":29,"verseKey":"75:29","textAr":"وَٱلۡتَفَّتِ ٱلسَّاقُ بِٱلسَّاقِ","transliteration":"Wailtaffati alssaqu bialssaqi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And the leg is wound about the leg"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور پنڈلی سے پنڈلی جڑ جائے گی"}]},{"ayah":30,"verseKey":"75:30","textAr":"إِلَىٰ رَبِّكَ يَوۡمَئِذٍ ٱلۡمَسَاقُ","transliteration":"Ila rabbika yawmaithin almasaqu","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"To your Lord, that Day, will be the procession"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"وہ دن ہوگا تیرے رب کی طرف روانگی کا"}]},{"ayah":31,"verseKey":"75:31","textAr":"فَلَا صَدَّقَ وَلَا صَلَّىٰ","transliteration":"Fala saddaqa wala salla","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And the disbeliever had not believed, nor had he prayed"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"مگر اُس نے نہ سچ مانا، اور نہ نماز پڑھی"}]},{"ayah":32,"verseKey":"75:32","textAr":"وَلَٰكِن كَذَّبَ وَتَوَلَّىٰ","transliteration":"Walakin kaththaba watawalla","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"But [instead], he denied and turned away"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"بلکہ جھٹلایا اور پلٹ گیا"}]},{"ayah":33,"verseKey":"75:33","textAr":"ثُمَّ ذَهَبَ إِلَىٰٓ أَهۡلِهِۦ يَتَمَطَّىٰٓ","transliteration":"Thumma thahaba ila ahlihi yatamatta","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And then he went to his people, swaggering [in pride]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر اکڑتا ہوا اپنے گھر والوں کی طرف چل دیا"}]},{"ayah":34,"verseKey":"75:34","textAr":"أَوۡلَىٰ لَكَ فَأَوۡلَىٰ","transliteration":"Awla laka faawla","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Woe to you, and woe"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہ روش تیرے ہی لیے سزاوار ہے اور تجھی کو زیب دیتی ہے"}]},{"ayah":35,"verseKey":"75:35","textAr":"ثُمَّ أَوۡلَىٰ لَكَ فَأَوۡلَىٰٓ","transliteration":"Thumma awla laka faawla","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then woe to you, and woe"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"ہاں یہ روش تیرے ہی لیے سزاوار ہے اور تجھی کو زیب دیتی ہے"}]},{"ayah":36,"verseKey":"75:36","textAr":"أَيَحۡسَبُ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ أَن يُتۡرَكَ سُدًى","transliteration":"Ayahsabu alinsanu an yutraka sudan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Does man think that he will be left neglected"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کیا انسان نے یہ سمجھ رکھا ہے کہ وہ یونہی مہمل چھوڑ دیا جائے گا؟"}]},{"ayah":37,"verseKey":"75:37","textAr":"أَلَمۡ يَكُ نُطۡفَةٗ مِّن مَّنِيّٖ يُمۡنَىٰ","transliteration":"Alam yaku nutfatan min manayyin yumna","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Had he not been a sperm from semen emitted"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کیا وہ ایک حقیر پانی کا نطفہ نہ تھا جو (رحم مادر میں) ٹپکایا جاتا ہے؟"}]},{"ayah":38,"verseKey":"75:38","textAr":"ثُمَّ كَانَ عَلَقَةٗ فَخَلَقَ فَسَوَّىٰ","transliteration":"Thumma kana AAalaqatan fakhalaqa fasawwa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Then he was a clinging clot, and [Allah] created [his form] and proportioned [him]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر وہ ایک لوتھڑا بنا، پھر اللہ نے اس کا جسم بنایا اور اس کے اعضا درست کیے"}]},{"ayah":39,"verseKey":"75:39","textAr":"فَجَعَلَ مِنۡهُ ٱلزَّوۡجَيۡنِ ٱلذَّكَرَ وَٱلۡأُنثَىٰٓ","transliteration":"FajaAAala minhu alzzawjayni alththakara waalontha","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And made of him two mates, the male and the female"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر اس سے مرد اور عورت کی دو قسمیں بنائیں"}]},{"ayah":40,"verseKey":"75:40","textAr":"أَلَيۡسَ ذَٰلِكَ بِقَٰدِرٍ عَلَىٰٓ أَن يُحۡـِۧيَ ٱلۡمَوۡتَىٰ","transliteration":"Alaysa thalika biqadirin AAala an yuhyiya almawta","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Is not that [Creator] Able to give life to the dead"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کیا وہ اِس پر قادر نہیں ہے کہ مرنے والوں کو پھر زندہ کر دے؟"}]}]}